	(text "HEATING BOARD - single-sided aluminium PCB (1.6 mm) under the printed lid: heat spreader for six Peltiers\nand their electronics.  All parts on the copper side (facing up, into the lid); bare aluminium faces the\nchamber (matt black).  No through-holes except NPTH: wires land on SMD pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0e976d89-6524-4ee6-b789-67e7c7a3f54e")
	)
	(text "THERMAL CUTOFF in the string: TCO1, Bourns SC72AAB\n72 +-5 C, holds itself open while driven;\nrecloses <= 57 C once unpowered.\nU2 OUT2 (PELT+) -> TCO1 -> PE5.1 (P6)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13e35469-868d-4a59-a518-98fc0f55ff0e")
	)
	(text "24 V SOFT START (lid v8): a live plug charges only D1 and Q1 (~1 A), not C16 / C25 / C26 through R17;\nQ1 then ramps VSS_L over a few ms, ~4-25 ms after contact, and U5 starts behind R17.  No capacitor on +24V.\nC23 <= 1 uF.  Re-plug >= 1 s after unplugging (the gate discharges through R21 || R22)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "37676eba-0fa4-4369-b5b6-45af68322a2a")
	)
	(text "1, 7 GND (the only ground)\n2 +24 V (the main board's rail, through its F2; v6)\n3 SDA  4 SCL (Teensy Wire1, pulled up there)\n5 IN1  6 IN2 (PWM 20-25 kHz, coast: one input PWM, the other low)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "60c984c5-7298-46a7-acfe-b39874d0128f")
	)
	(text "TEMPERATURES + MONITORS: two ADS1115 on the lid's own I2C bus (0x48, 0x49); NTCs ratiometric to 3.3 V,\nand 3.3 V itself measured directly (U3 AIN3, FSR 4.096 V) so the firmware can work ratiometrically"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "63094a78-6a56-43c2-b040-4ad098e60741")
	)
	(text "0 OHM JUMPERS (one copper layer): JP1 carries 3V3 from C2 to C8 over C8's ground link to C2 / U1; JP2 C25 -> C26's ground over VBUCK's drop into the buck;\nJP3 U3's ground over T_MED / SDA / SCL to its NTCs' lane; JP4 +24 V from J1.2 over J1.1's ground"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68eb867f-d1e1-4a93-a448-cb7db406b763")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS (copper side, 1.5 mm pads)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6d60bd9f-fdc9-41d3-ac73-c2f551ee5a8b")
	)
	(text "3.3 V: HT7533-1 (30 V max) behind R16 from the lid's 9.16 V, which drops ~1.3 V and filters spikes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7af200ad-eee6-4740-84a7-fa1e8b48e45e")
	)
	(text "PELTIERS (TES1-4902, 20 x 20 mm): both leads off the edge towards the slot, at its corners (pad 1 / pad 2, same colour on all six); thermal paste"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7eaaef89-9d7f-4940-839b-7b956507fad1")
	)
	(text "U3 (0x49): AIN0 = PELT+ / 11, AIN1 = PELT- / 11, AIN2 = T_B, AIN3 = T_MED.  U4 (0x48): AIN0 = T_EDGE, AIN1 = 3.3 V, AIN2 = T_A, AIN3 = T_TOP\n(string voltage = 11 x (AIN0 - AIN1) on U3: MUX 000).  NTC: T = f(R), R = 10k x V / (V33 - V); PGA +-4.096 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 251.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e468e22-d25a-49ec-9827-a3d4ae123306")
	)
	(text "PELTIER DRIVE (9.16 V from U5; its 4 x 22 uF output caps sit at VM): H-bridge straight onto the six modules in series (<= 0.67 A at full duty); I_TRIP 64/R3 = 1.25 A\nPWM with coast (IN1 = PWM, IN2 = 0, or the reverse), never drive / brake: firmware.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a57c91aa-3f8e-43df-a5b6-bb548b835c0a")
	)
	(text "LID BUCK (v6): +24V -> R17 1 R -> U5 TPS5430 -> L1 22 uH -> +9V (9.16 V, <= 0.75 A): the bridge and the LDO"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ab774817-39c4-4e54-af17-a5b08742e3d3")
	)
	(text "RT1 / RT2: in the board, midway between PE2 and PE3 (strip A) and between PE4 and PE5 (strip B), facing\neach other across the slot: the warmest spots.  RT3: at the -X edge beyond the slot end, the coldest.\nJ2: glass-bead NTC dipping into the medium at the tip row.  J3: NTC bonded to the top plate (dew-point limit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 243.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d0b610f2-278a-4a6a-b536-a66ce2313377")
	)
	(text "CABLE (soldered, 7 x 24-26 AWG) from the main board's lid port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "eda48149-f68d-41df-9d84-ed92c7c30002")
	)
